    93	
    94	### Auxiliary reachability claims
    95	
    96	- `SPEC.inner-loop` is the inner-loop circularity. It executes the exact
    97	  membership test, append call, and column increment. It updates only
    98	  `column_index`, `value`, and the output heap object as stated.
    99	- `SPEC.outer-loop` is the outer-loop circularity. It executes the exact row
