  ✓ Stage 4 — audit claim adequacy, satisfiability, real-program pinning, and concrete witnesses
  ✓ Stage 5 — inventory and review every syntax/function/rule/claim for soundness
  ✓ Stage 6 — create and run a fresh meaningful false mutation
  ✓ Stage 7 — account for proven versus assumed facts and write REVIEW.md with the exact verdict markers
